-~> puts of a string is plain; strings inside arrays and hashes are shown
-~> as code, with escapes, so the text can be pasted back.
puts("say \"hi\"")
puts(["say \"hi\"", 1, "a\\b"])
puts({"k": "line\nbreak", "t": "tab\there"})
puts([["deep \"x\""]])
puts(str(["a", "b"]))
puts(str("plain"))
puts(len(str(["a"])))
puts(["ñandú"])
